主入蜀。蜀既定，为犍为属国都尉〖44〗；因易郡名〖45〗，为朱提太守。（选）〔迁〕为安远将军，降都督，住南昌县〖46〗。章武二年卒。失其行事，故不为传。","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":93},{"id":"dengzhang-q2-de589e02f511e5fc56a5","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-0124066f75aa2fc9a4be","layer":"original","quote":"蜀既定，为犍为属国都尉〖44〗；因易郡名〖45〗，为朱提太守。（选）〔迁〕为安远将军，降都督，住南昌县〖46〗。","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":77},{"id":"huangli-q-54d39aa2add2efc5da5d","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-8cc6be2ec39d53c1f31b","layer":"original","quote":"章武元年，降都督邓方卒","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11},{"id":"huangli-q-6bde1a046c8d478e575c","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-8cc6be2ec39d53c1f31b","layer":"original","quote":"先主问恢：“谁可代者？”恢对曰：“人之才能，各有长短。故孔子曰：‘其使人也器之〖8〗。’且夫明主在上，则臣下尽情；是以先零之役〖9〗，赵充国曰‘莫若老臣〖10〗’。臣窃不自（揆）〔量〕，惟陛下察之","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":12,"end":110}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
